Crust development areas

This list records areas to review and improve. It is not a list of wholly missing
features; many already have an implementation. Check docs/FEATURES_AND_KEYBINDS.md
for the current feature reference.

Plugins and accounts
- Plugin lifecycle, multi-account behavior, moderation tools, chatter analytics,
  and configurable stream delay.

Live events
- Follows, subscriptions, gift subscriptions, raids, channel points, poll and
  prediction lifecycles, stream status, and reconnect/backfill handling.

Channel points
- Redemption messages, reward metadata, moderator actions, and redemption UI.

Moderation
- Fast right-click actions, timeout presets, moderation logs, AutoMod queues,
  low-trust controls, and unban requests.

Filters and highlights
- Per-channel and global rules, regular expressions, user and content filters,
  highlight sounds and colors, and mention rules.

User cards
- Follow age, account age, pronouns, shared channels, recent messages, badges,
  and role context.

Messages
- Replies and threads, deleted and cleared messages, consistent system notices,
  and timestamp settings.

Commands and input
- Twitch command coverage, slash-command help, suggestion ranking, and history.

Tabs and splits
- Split controls, unread and mention counts, and keyboard navigation.

Emotes
- Favorites, recent emotes, provider priority, picker search, and usage ranking.

History and search
- Recent-message fetching on join, in-channel search, and local log indexing.
